    skos:definition 'Ports which facilitate predominantly commercial traffic (resource and goods transport) and potentially the transport of people, though to a much lesser degree.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:A04::CommercialFerryPorts'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/A04/current/Demographics/1/> .
